    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "2659dc97b0043a8db110": "Train me.",
        "556e9bb06c4df6edb46a": "My skill at creating potions is inferior to yours. You are ready to speak with Ainethil, just over there. She will understand that you are ready for further instruction.",
        "9f7bc7bb007fe2a43686": "Ah, to be young again, and to have discovered potions for the first time. Thank you for refreshing my memory, $n. Now go share that youthful enthusiasm with Milla Fairancora over there.",
        "b6489a56ae57cd634974": "I have learned much of potions over the long years, $n, and that knowledge is at your disposal. You have only to ask.",
        "c5cd8b2811be38f1e4c1": "Even slight alterations to a potion's ingredients can change it fundamentally. Patience and precision, young one: they will serve you well in all walks of life."
      },
      "name": "Sylvanna Forestmoon",
      "subName": "Expert Alchemist",
      "translationMetadata": {
